## JavaScript edition (acknowledged, not copied)

BimCraft originates as a JavaScript application, "BimCraft — the CadCraft
family" (https://github.com/getcadcraft/bimcraft), licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. The Rust edition is an independent, clean-room implementation of
the same product concept. No JavaScript source from the original repository
is compiled into, vendored by, or copied into the Rust edition. The original
repository is referenced in this workspace as a git submodule
(`clone/bimcraft-js`) purely as the behavioural feature reference for the
parity roadmap.

